    "3421eb3f044d": {
      "original": "解析 FunASR 识别结果，按顺序提取标签和纯文本内容\n\n    Args:\n        text: ASR 识别的原始文本，可能包含多种标签\n\n    Returns:\n        dict: {\"language\": \"zh\", \"emotion\": \"SAD\", \"emoji\": \"😔\", \"content\": \"Olá\"} 如果有标签\n        str: 纯文本，如果没有标签\n\n    Examples:\n        FunASR 输出格式：<|语种|><|情绪|><|事件|><|其他选项|>原文\n        >>> lang_tag_filter(\"<|zh|><|SAD|><|Fala|><|withitn|>Olá, teste teste.\")\n        {\"language\": \"zh\", \"emotion\": \"SAD\", \"emoji\": \"😔\", \"content\": \"Olá, teste de teste.\"}\n        >>> lang_tag_filter(\"<|en|><|HAPPY|><|Speech|><|withitn|>Hello hello.\")\n        {\"language\": \"en\", \"emotion\": \"HAPPY\", \"emoji\": \"🙂\", \"content\": \"Hello hello.\"}\n        >>> lang_tag_filter(\"plain text\")\n        \"plain text\"",
      "source_lang": "zh",
